=== SUMMARY ===
data sources : none at the page level (web parity: SystemPage owns no hook). RateLimitStatusPanel binds the shared S8 SystemStore (rateLimitStatus() cache-then-network) via its self-fetching overload; QueueStatusPanel is driven by SystemPageViewModel over the shared S8 SystemQueuesStore (queueStatus() -> UiState<QueueStatusResponse>); QueueJobDrawer binds the same SystemQueuesStore (queueJobs(worker)). No HTTP in the view.
nav          : standalone composable("adminSystem") in TeslaSyncNavHost -> SystemRoute() via PageHosts.register (SystemPageHost). NOT a Destinations row (web /admin/system is outside the locked 137-page taxonomy). No deep link (web route is unrouted). All nav unit tests green.
states       : the loading / empty / hard-error+Retry / stale-offline / content states are all rendered by the two composed feature views' UiState projections (rate-limit feed in RateLimitStatusPanel; worker feed in QueueStatusPanel); the wrapper adds no separate data region, so no region is ever blank (ADR-011).
a11y/theme   : header uses PageTitle (heading semantics) + BodyText on MaterialTheme.colorScheme tokens (dark/dynamic theme, ADR-005/ADR-015); the feature views + drawer carry their own card/control content descriptions and >2min staleness chips (ADR-013). SI is formatted at the display boundary inside the feature views, never stored/computed non-SI.
diagnostics  : page records the one-shot PII-safe view.opened (surface="SystemPage", P1/S11), distinct from each feature view's own.
